
flowchart TD
    A([Open CASMS Application]) --> B[Login Page]
    B --> C{Valid Login?}
    C -- No --> D[Show Error Message]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E{Password Change Required?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Change Password]
    F --> G[Role-Based Dashboard]
    E -- No --> G

    G --> H{User Role?}

    H -- Admin --> I[Manage Users and Master Data]
    I --> J[Register and Manage Assets]
    J --> K[(Save Asset Information)]
    K --> L[Asset Register and History]

    H -- Admin --> M[Review Open Service Requests]
    H -- Staff / Faculty --> N[View Permitted Assets]
    N --> O[Raise Service Request]
    O --> P{Asset Eligible?}
    P -- No --> Q[Show Validation Error]
    Q --> N
    P -- Yes --> R[Request Created - Open]

    R --> M
    M --> S[Assign Active Technician]
    S --> T[Request Status - Assigned]

    H -- Technician --> U[View Assigned Requests]
    T --> U
    U --> V[Start Work - In Progress]
    V --> W{Repair On Hold?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Status - On Hold]
    X --> V
    W -- No --> Y[Enter Diagnosis, Parts and Costs]

    Y --> Z[Call Closure Stored Procedure]
    Z --> AA{Transaction Successful?}
    AA -- No --> AB[Rollback All Changes]
    AB --> Y
    AA -- Yes --> AC[Close Request and Save Maintenance]
    AC --> AD[Update Asset Status]
    AD --> AE[Save History, Audit and Notification]
    AE --> AF[Dashboard and Reports]

    L --> AF
    AF --> AG([End])
